# @airing-cal/v3-read-worker — local vars (never commit real values)
#
# Bindings live in wrangler.toml:
#   AIRINGCAL_PUBLIC_R2 → R2 bucket holding the immutable v3 public store
#     (`public/current-release.json` pointer + generation-scoped
#      `public/manifests/*` manifest (C1) + snapshots + images).
#
# Worker vars:
#   BANGUMI_GIT_COMMIT_SHA — build revision rendered on `/`
#   AIRINGCAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL — verified public CDN/S3 base URL (absolute https).
#     Validated when the read config is built: placeholders such as
#     `https://PLACEHOLDER_PUBLIC_CDN` fail closed as 503 INVALID_READ_CONFIG.
#     When set, `/image/:hash` 302s to `{BASE}/images/...`; when unset, image
#     bytes are proxied from the R2 public store.
#
# NSFW_SHOW is a Compose/node setting; this Worker reads the public store only
# and reports `scheduler: 'external'` on `/api/health`.
#
# Staging deploys: `.github/workflows/v3-read-worker-staging.yml` (dispatch only,
# Environment `staging`, AIRINGCAL_STAGING_* secrets/vars only).
BANGUMI_GIT_COMMIT_SHA=
AIRINGCAL_PUBLIC_BASE_URL=
